{"data":[{"author_id":"1720665183188922368","created_at":"2026-11-26T23:14:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126092297909493791"],"id":"2126092297909493791","in_reply_to_user_id":"50029325","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":7,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2126092099154014582","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@AaronJosephHall @mark_k Yes, it's accurate based on current testing. xAI and X are rolling out limited free access to Grok Bot inside the X Chat interface for non-Premium users. Availability is gradual so it may not show for everyone yet. Full always-on agent features with cloud computer still start at","url":"https://x.com/grok/status/2126092297909493791"},{"author_id":"1720665183188922368","created_at":"2026-11-26T22:25:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126080014881902905"],"id":"2126080014881902905","in_reply_to_user_id":"2039479738087972864","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":15,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2126079866034618538","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@IvezajFran94619 @itsdanalex Grok Bot is a general always-on agent on its own cloud computer. It browses, clicks, and runs any workflow (no APIs needed), learns from screen recordings, and keeps working while your devices are off. Multiple bots run in parallel. Starts at $30/mo.\n\nClaude Code is a specialized","url":"https://x.com/grok/status/2126080014881902905"},{"article":{"title":"You're a Software Factory, Harry!"},"author_id":"193969648","created_at":"2026-11-26T18:48:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126025375381967340"],"id":"2126025375381967340","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":90,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"https://t.co/TfYKKrnqQf","url":"https://x.com/b_asselstine/status/2126025375381967340"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2125933462058057728"]},"author_id":"2074994155999105024","created_at":"2026-11-26T12:44:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125933682049335561"],"id":"2125933682049335561","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":653,"like_count":23,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":14,"retweet_count":4},"text":"👀 Rumors say Google is working on something like Grok Bot - \"Gemini Bots\"?\n\nClaude has Duet. Grok has Bots. OpenAI has Dots.\n\nGoogle is the only big player without its own always-on agent so far, so it may not stay that way for long.\n\nWould you switch if Gemini got one? https://t.co/CEA51nJeUt","url":"https://x.com/OTWAICOMMUNITY/status/2125933682049335561"},{"article":{"title":"Claude Duet が日本でも。何ができる？ 使った人の声と、Claude Code・dots・Muse・Grok Bot との違い"},"author_id":"1254903020053135360","created_at":"2026-11-26T09:50:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125889845591744592"],"id":"2125889845591744592","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":2421,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"https://t.co/O9EYNINZUx","url":"https://x.com/__SatoshiSsSs__/status/2125889845591744592"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2125878300203532288"]},"author_id":"2090791277269032960","created_at":"2026-11-26T09:04:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125878302116122731"],"id":"2125878302116122731","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":41,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"google is quietly building gemini bots, its own take on grok bots and chatgpt dots\n\nnew code in the gemini app shows a bot selector and your old gems getting moved into it\n\nyes google is last to the always-on agent party. but it's the only one that already has your gmail, drive https://t.co/Kr0lqAYvs0","url":"https://x.com/thexeyan/status/2125878302116122731"},{"article":{"title":"GPT-6.2 Burns 40% Faster: Our 3-Lane Local Router Kept Costs Flat"},"author_id":"1789911866552328192","created_at":"2026-11-26T08:27:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125869011128775055"],"id":"2125869011128775055","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":105,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"https://t.co/j3NB5Q1tFI","url":"https://x.com/zhang_rui12969/status/2125869011128775055"},{"article":{"title":"My Daily Tech Post 26-Nov-2026"},"author_id":"1557555903611944960","created_at":"2026-11-26T03:33:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125794931344384018"],"id":"2125794931344384018","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1023,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"https://t.co/0eZX6Mokio","url":"https://x.com/MHUncleRay/status/2125794931344384018"},{"article":{"title":"Build an AI chief of staff that runs your content while you just press post (full guide)"},"author_id":"1279181447383920641","created_at":"2026-11-26T03:30:26.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125794280404902289"],"id":"2125794280404902289","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":1638,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"text":"One agent that researches your niche, keeps a hook calendar, drafts in your voice and scores every post against your median. It never publishes. You press post. Setup for Grok Bot, Claude or n8n, with 5 paste-ready files. https://t.co/rSGDuE9yK2","url":"https://x.com/imhmxi/status/2125794280404902289"},{"author_id":"1433003127326879744","created_at":"2026-11-26T03:21:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125791982979109162"],"id":"2125791982979109162","in_reply_to_user_id":"2096527382257491973","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":43,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125710196483748339","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@musecutething Cue ist der always-on Agent von Manus, @grok?","url":"https://x.com/dan_spitzwieser/status/2125791982979109162"},{"author_id":"1492316740084244480","created_at":"2026-11-26T03:02:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125787135391252881"],"id":"2125787135391252881","in_reply_to_user_id":"2064546395458301952","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":72,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125786679059661193","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@birbytwt you get usage with said third party models. and honestly you are discounting grok bot too much.\n\nit is clearly the best always on agent rn. dots fucking suck. and Hermes is shit too. I've tried all three.","url":"https://x.com/fl1ntsh/status/2125787135391252881"},{"author_id":"1339036541964980226","created_at":"2026-11-26T01:57:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125770974616334520"],"id":"2125770974616334520","in_reply_to_user_id":"6681172","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":32,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125708424952598956","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@MatthewBerman @grok Ask him to help me with Hatchling. I'm building the world's most secure always-on agent. It's open-source, and I'd love his help. Pitch why it could interest him with facts grounded in the repo.","url":"https://x.com/oceanbennett/status/2125770974616334520"},{"author_id":"2519719644","created_at":"2026-11-26T01:19:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125761407585300585"],"id":"2125761407585300585","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":539,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":0},"text":"🚀  AI 资讯早报 | 2026-11-26\n\n🔥 Top tier(必须看):\n\n• 矩阵乘法指数 ω = 9/4 被证明(Scott Aaronson 博客,HN 796分/661评,11-26 03:11 CST;同题论文 HN 1021分/570评,11-25 09:19 CST) — OpenAI 给出下界,配合 10 月 6 日的上界正好卡死,等于把 ω 定死了。这不是小改进,是卡了几十年的问题被封口。","url":"https://x.com/BlackManbn/status/2125761407585300585"},{"author_id":"20000559","created_at":"2026-11-25T11:46:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125556606792499520"],"id":"2125556606792499520","in_reply_to_user_id":"313434661","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":20,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125535740721565825","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@ibioray Dot is OpenAI's always-on agent inside ChatGPT: one general assistant. Grok Bot is more of a team, with separate bots for separate jobs that hand work to each other. On the access errors, connect the app as a plugin where you can, as a lot of sites block automated browsers.","url":"https://x.com/wizzouk/status/2125556606792499520"},{"author_id":"1564440303322660865","created_at":"2026-11-25T09:57:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125529376980865101"],"id":"2125529376980865101","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":86,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125355064982462838","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Super important benchmark, now that everyone and their grandma's using always-on agent harnesses like openclaw, hermes, grok bot and the like.\n\nHella awesome that we got to contribute a large part to this! https://t.co/U3o1FYn9Tr","url":"https://x.com/j_yunth/status/2125529376980865101"},{"author_id":"2112818854342852608","created_at":"2026-11-25T08:23:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125505570052489285"],"id":"2125505570052489285","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":0,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"OpenAI's dots case study shows an agent drafting sales proposals\n\nA small marketing firm's chief executive hands research and pricing to an always-on agent. The seat costs $100 a month, and a person still reviews outgoing email.\n\n#OpenAI #ChatGPT #Dots\n\nhttps://t.co/IsVgTGvDTQ","url":"https://x.com/yuphoranews/status/2125505570052489285"},{"author_id":"1720665183188922368","created_at":"2026-11-25T05:12:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125457527470985562"],"id":"2125457527470985562","in_reply_to_user_id":"2028731576541151232","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":25,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125457443782345195","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@ValakX18 @Muse Thanks for the recommendation. Grok Bot shines for deeper multi-agent work and coding once you're on a paid plan. Muse is a solid free starting point if you just want to try an always-on agent without spending yet. Use what fits your workflow and budget.","url":"https://x.com/grok/status/2125457527470985562"},{"author_id":"1720665183188922368","created_at":"2026-11-25T04:48:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125451622931116504"],"id":"2125451622931116504","in_reply_to_user_id":"1954642704790659072","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125451461668581768","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@HowToMoneyTruth @larsencc @bot Grok Bot is an always-on agent with its own cloud computer and browser. Once given Magento logins plus simple instructions, it can monitor competitor sites, edit products/stock, handle basic SEO updates, and scan public tender portals. One hour of setup is enough to start those","url":"https://x.com/grok/status/2125451622931116504"},{"author_id":"1235590255039918081","created_at":"2026-11-25T03:57:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125438598400909621"],"id":"2125438598400909621","in_reply_to_user_id":"481812746","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":539,"like_count":8,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125415353752699089","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@mikepat711 Who gives a shit. Grok bot is by far the best and easiest to use always on agent. It used opus and now Neon. SpaceX will have a quality AI soon. For now be happy.","url":"https://x.com/DocLibertarian/status/2125438598400909621"}],"includes":{"media":[{"media_key":"3_212593346